   {
    "op": "note",
    "ref": "P26",
    "text": "Fridge 1311992 for the Police, in the 2-storey building. It came on 14 Oct 2026, the day it was due, with T0265's four fridges; it was put on P46 (QPS Command Post) on 15 Oct and moved here 17 Oct. Andrew, 17 Oct 2026: \"1311992 - These were for the Police\" ... \"The ones for police can go in 2 story building are P26 & P28\" ... \"So did the fridges\" (turned up on the correct day). Recorded on site 17 Oct; on site since 14 Oct."
   },
   {
    "op": "note",
    "ref": "P28",
    "text": "Fridge 1283996 for the Police, in the 2-storey building. It came on 14 Oct 2026, the day it was due, with T0265's four fridges; it was put on P46 (QPS Command Post) on 15 Oct and moved here 17 Oct. Andrew, 17 Oct 2026: \"1283996 - These were for the Police\" ... \"The ones for police can go in 2 story building are P26 & P28\" ... \"So did the fridges\" (turned up on the correct day). Recorded on site 17 Oct; on site since 14 Oct."
   },
   {
    "op": "note",
    "ref": "P34",
    "text": "The chairs came on 14 Oct 2026, the day they were due. Andrew, 17 Oct 2026: \"the swivel chairs turned up on the correct day\". The schedule calls them Pad Chair x 2. Recorded on site 17 Oct; on site since 14 Oct."
   }
  ]
